A single implicit posting resolves every commodity in the transaction.

========== API ==========

aggregate({ accounts: ['^Equity:Opening$'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Fund
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  10 SEK
  Assets:Fund  2 FUND
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Equity:Opening",
    "commodity": "FUND",
    "quantity": "-2"
  },
  {
    "account": "Equity:Opening",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "-10"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[MISSING_DEFAULT_COMMODITY] Journal must declare one default commodity
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:1:1
